{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.poster.avif?t=1761930416\" width=1024 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.webm?t=1761930416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your sanity as you take control of Henry in this third person horror experience taking place during the events of Bendy and the Dark Revival\u00ae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condemned to the Keeper prison known as &quot;The Pit&quot;, Henry must survive the horrific inmates and mangled experiments set loose to devour him. A labyrinth of steel industrial dread lay before him as his mind is invaded by the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden blood-stained truth behind the monsters as you explore the dark levels of The Pit, slowly making your way to the very top of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the darkness with your axe in brutal melee combat: Unleash fast and heavy strikes, block and parry incoming attacks, shove foes away, stomp on enemies with a vengeance, and time dodges to avoid being torn apart by the things that hunt you. Dive into the shadows for limited supplies as you embark on a twisted tale of Henry's self discovery while facing down new and familiar creatures of the ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the maestro. Escape the prison. Fight the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/33cb39d5c565a7e8391c2d1042737a56.avif?t=1761930416\" width=1024 height=246 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2663960?t=1761930416","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/804cede5b7a0bfb463e65f348156e2be82aaa539/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761930416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/e944831d3e65703337cc439afb80f581a1637267/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761930416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/e944831d3e65703337cc439afb80f581a1637267/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761930416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains depictions of bloody violence, gore, and torture. Psychological horror, scary images, and mature themes."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.poster.avif?t=1761930416\" width=1024 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.webm?t=1761930416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your sanity as you take control of Henry in this third person horror experience taking place during the events of Bendy and the Dark Revival\u00ae.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condemned to the Keeper prison known as &quot;The Pit&quot;, Henry must survive the horrific inmates and mangled experiments set loose to devour him. A labyrinth of steel industrial dread lay before him as his mind is invaded by the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden blood-stained truth behind the monsters as you explore the dark levels of The Pit, slowly making your way to the very top of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the darkness with your axe in brutal melee combat: Unleash fast and heavy strikes, block and parry incoming attacks, shove foes away, stomp on enemies with a vengeance, and time dodges to avoid being torn apart by the things that hunt you. Dive into the shadows for limited supplies as you embark on a twisted tale of Henry's self discovery while facing down new and familiar creatures of the ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the maestro. Escape the prison. Fight the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/33cb39d5c565a7e8391c2d1042737a56.avif?t=1761930416\" width=1024 height=246 /></span></p>","developers":["Joey Drew Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/63c89b8cd5f5b49a1e63dd7161031673a30c1968/header.jpg?t=1761930416","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2017-2024 Joey Drew Studios Inc. <br />\r\nBendy\u00ae, Bendy: The Cage\u00ae, The Bendy characters, images and logos are trademarks of Joey Drew Studios Inc. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<str